DLC_Dat["Seasons of the Worm Cult"].name="Seasons of the Worm Cult"
DLC_Dat["Seasons of the Worm Cult"].dat={
4264, -- Deetra Grotto Group Event,  Defeat Captain Xiha at Deetra Grotto.
4265, -- Deetra Grotto Conqueror,  Defeat all of the champions in Deetra Grotto.
4266, -- Ossein Cage Vanquisher,  Defeat the Shapers of Flesh, Jynorah and Skorkhif, as well as Overfiend Kazpian in Ossein Cage.
4267, -- Breakneck Battler,  Defeat all enemies and 3 abductor mini-bosses in addition to the Shapers of Flesh, Jynorah and Skorkhif, as well as Overfiend Kazpian within 45 minutes of entering Veteran Ossein Cage. Your timer starts when you enter Ossein Cage.
4268, -- Ossein Cage Conqueror,  Defeat the Shapers of Flesh, Jynorah and Skorkhif, as well as Overfiend Kazpian in Veteran Ossein Cage.
4269, -- Thriving in Adversity,  Defeat all enemies and 3 abductor mini-bosses in addition to the Shapers of Flesh, Jynorah and Skorkhif, as well as Overfiend Kazpian without suffering a group member death in Veteran Ossein Cage.
4275, -- Titanic Triumph,  Defeat Jynorah and Skorkhif after raising the challenge banner in Veteran Ossein Cage.
4278, -- Portal Party,  In a full group, have every member of the group use a Carrion portal at least once when battling the Shapers of Flesh in Veteran Ossein Cage.
4279, -- Burnt to a Crisp,  As an individual, defeat Jynorah and Skorkhif after being affected by both Sparking Enfeeblement and Blazing Enfeeblement at the same time throughout both Titanic Clash phases in Veteran Ossein Cage. Titanic Clash phases begin when the lower platform becomes Superheated and end when it is no longer Superheated.
4415, -- Bearer of Life and Death,  Complete "The Gift of Death" quest in Western Solstice.
4434, -- Solstice Climbing Club,  Uncover the hidden chest at the top of the neatly stacked Argonian ruin.
4435, -- Sanguine's Delights,  Drink the Rose Stained Tinctures, gifts from Sanguine, found hidden across Solstice.
4454, -- Siege Camp Liberator,  Reclaim a Stirk Fellowship siege camp in Western Solstice after it falls to encroaching Worm Cult forces.
4455, -- Soul Shriven on Solstice,  Five Soul Shriven have wandered free of Coldharbour, but tatters of memory torment them with recollections of their past lives. Find them and help settle their troubled minds.
4406, -- Hero of Western Solstice,  Complete quests, defeat bosses, and explore delves to become the Hero of Western Solstice.
4409, -- Defender of Western Solstice,  Defeat the three group bosses in Western Solstice.
4411, -- Fellowship Assembler,  Complete "The Stirk Fellowship" quest in Western Solstice.
4412, -- Sunport Savior,  Complete "The Regent of Sunport" quest in Western Solstice.
4413, -- Swept Downstream,  Complete "The Passages Beneath" quest in Western Solstice.
4414, -- Archmage Whisperer,  Complete "The Writhing Wall" quest in Western Solstice.
4432, -- Wanderers of Western Solstice,  Find the adventurous wanderers of Western Solstice.
4433, -- So Clean in Sunport,  Stop to bathe in the various ponds and baths of Sunport.
4449, -- Barrier Buster,  Complete the "Crossing the Wall" quest in Western Solstice.
4301, -- Group Patience,  As an individual, have the damage dealt by Caustic Carrion reset by a Carrion Shield at least 3 times during a single trip through a Carrion Portal in Ossein Cage.
4300, -- Successful Strike,  As a group, defeat Channelers without allowing any party member who used the corresponding Carrion Portal to die in Veteran Ossein Cage.
4299, -- Familiar Foes,  As a group, keep Molag Kena and Low Warden Dusk alive until the end and never kill them when battling Overfiend Kazpian in Veteran Ossein Cage.
4298, -- Share the Misery,  In a full group, ensure that every member of your party goes over to the side island at least once when battling Overfiend Kazpian in Veteran Ossein Cage.
4297, -- Avoiding Agony,  As a group, don't let anyone aside from the initial target get hit by the Agonizer Bomb explosion when battling Overfiend Kazpian in Veteran Ossein Cage.
4450, -- Sentinel of the Siege Camps,  Defend or recapture each of the following Stirk Fellowship siege camps in Western Solstice.
4287, -- Seeking Wo-Xeeth,  Defeat Wo-Xeeth, the Soul-Shriven Behemoth, at Wo-Xeeth's Lair.
4286, -- To Haunt the Soul,  Defeat Soulcaller, Voidmother of Coldharbour, at Soulcaller's Haunt.
4451, -- Worm Cult Champion Slayer,  Defeat at least 15 of the following Worm Cult champions at Stirk Fellowship siege camps in Western Solstice.
4452, -- Siege Camp Vanguard,  Defend Stirk Fellowship siege camps in Western Solstice five times while preventing encroaching Worm Cult forces from capturing the camp.
4453, -- Siege Camp Tactician,  Defend a Stirk Fellowship siege camp in Western Solstice to prevent encroaching Worm Cult forces from capturing any part of the camp.
4457, -- The Legend of Atlorn the Lost,  Sailor tales tell of a long lost deckhand who yearns to return home to his beloved husband. Seek out the legend and await his appearance on the long bridge south of Bismuth Grotto.
4280, -- Most Victorious,  Observe both outcomes of the final duel between Sparkstorm Myrinax and Blazeforged Valneer in Veteran Ossein Cage.
4276, -- Served Suffering,  Defeat the Shapers of Flesh, Jynorah and Skorkhif, as well as Overfiend Kazpian after raising the challenge banner in Veteran Ossein Cage, in one run.
4274, -- Fears of the Flesh,  Defeat the Shapers of Flesh after raising the challenge banner in Veteran Ossein Cage.
4464, -- Broken Shackle, Bitter Victory,  Complete "The Worm Turns" quest in Eastern Solstice.
4465, -- After the Archmagus,  Complete "Hunt for the Great Mage" quest in Eastern Solstice.
4466, -- Beneath Stone and Story,  Complete "The Deep Tombs of Xul-Haj" quest in Eastern Solstice.
4467, -- To Siege Oblivion Itself,  Complete "The Gates of Mor Naril" quest in Eastern Solstice.
4468, -- A Light in the Dark,  Complete "The Final Dark" quest in Eastern Solstice.
4469, -- A Promised Drink,  Complete "The Golden Knight" after completing the Eastern Solstice main quest.
4470, -- Champion of Solstice,  Rally the Fellowship, ride out with your allies, and finally end the threat of the Worm Cult across Western and Eastern Solstice.
4471, -- Calindvale Gardens Group Event,  Defeat the Brooding Infernium in Calindvale Gardens.
4477, -- Savior of Solstice,  Complete quests, explore, acquire antiquities, and become the Savior of Solstice.
4475, -- Hero of Solstice,  Complete quests, defeat bosses, and explore delves to become the Hero of Solstice.
4472, -- Calindvale Gardens Conqueror,  Defeat all of the champions in Calindvale Gardens.
4473, -- Defender of Eastern Solstice,  Defeat the three group bosses in Eastern Solstice.
4474, -- Hero of Eastern Solstice,  Complete quests, defeat bosses, and explore delves to become the Hero of Eastern Solstice.
4272, -- Lord of Suffering,  Defeat the Shapers of Flesh, Jynorah and Skorkhif, as well as Overfiend Kazpian after raising the challenge banner for each of them, plus all their hostile followers including all 3 abductor mini-bosses, without suffering a group member death, within 45 minutes of entering Veteran Ossein Cage.
4273, -- Worth the Pain,  Complete the following list of achievements for Veteran Ossein Cage.
4277, -- Flesh Swarmed,  Ensure 6 Fleshspawn are present at the same time without forming a Flesh Abomination and kill all 6 Fleshspawn in Veteran Ossein Cage.
4281, -- Heating Up,  After raising the challenge banner in Veteran Ossein Cage, enter the second Titanic Clash phase after every party member has taken damage from at least one Sparking Heat Ray and one Blazing Heat Ray, without exiting and reentering the same cast of Heat Ray that applied the effect.
4282, -- Behemoth and the Beasts,  Defeat Gaulm the Vahath Behemoth at the ruins of Tuniria.
4283, -- We are Legion,  Defeat the legion of Voskrona Guardians at the ruins of the Shrine of Vakkan.
4284, -- Spite the Tide,  Defeat Tidespite at Tidewash Strand.
4285, -- Ghish What Will Happen Next,  Defeat the Maldrith Ghishzor at the Zyv-Elehk Ritual Site.
4302, -- Living Well,  Defeat Red Witch Gedna Relvel, the Tortured Trio, and Blood Drinker Thisa in Veteran Ossein Cage.
}
